@SamuelMotal @SebiSolidwork "The tests" are not part of the car.  "The tests" are not part of the code.

Testing is what happens when you examine parts of the car, and perform experiments on them, looking for trouble.

Testing is what happens when you put the car out on a track or road and try driving it.

